# Aegis persistence

System of record: PostgreSQL. Redis is deferred (ADR 0003). Schema changes require Alembic migrations; no silent auto-alter in production.

## Migrations

- Add new revision files under `alembic/versions/`; do not edit an already-applied revision.
- Prefer `alembic upgrade head` for local and Compose startup paths.
- Do not run `alembic downgrade` unless the owner explicitly requests it.

## Models

- Keep `audit_events` append-only.
- When order/position tables exist, separate paper and live state with `ledger_kind` (or equivalent discriminator).
- Do not store API secrets, signatures, or raw credential material in columns or JSONB.
- Prefer correlation IDs on decision artifacts for end-to-end traces.

